==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Genius''' under {{Faction|Cephalon Suda}}, or the rank of '''Partner''' under {{Faction|The Perrin Sequence}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Damage vulnerability is affected by [[Ability Strength]].
*Damage vulnerability is multiplicative to {{M|Finishing Touch}}.
*Causes Silence's stagger to open enemies to [[Finisher#Front/Back Finisher|standing finisher attacks]]. Silence without the Augment will not set up (alerted) enemies for finisher attacks.
**Staggering effects that set enemies up for finisher attacks also makes them take increased damage from regular melee attacks due to [[Stealth#Stealth Damage Bonus|stealth damage bonus]].
*Enemies affected by Savage Silence also take increased {{D|Finisher}} damage from Warframe abilities that deal {{D|Finisher}} damage, notably {{A|Blade Storm}}.
*Approaching stunned enemies upfront and killing them won't break the [[Affinity#Stealth Kill Affinity Bonus|stealth affinity multiplier]].
**In similar fashion, bumping into stunned enemies won't break the multiplier either.

==Tips==
*Synergizes well with the {{Weapon|Zakti}} pistol, as the {{D|Gas}} explosions will open enemies to finishers, allowing Banshee to simply have Silence active to deal increased {{D|Finisher}} damage on any enemy without needing low range or duration to re-stun enemies.
*Can allow for consistent proccing of on-finisher effects, such as {{Arcane|Arcane Trickery}} and {{Arcane|Arcane Ultimatum}}.

